{
  "_note": "S3 六层互斥切分：层前缀按目录子树对齐（check-arch 的多命中判据要求层间不相交，族根与其子包不可分属两层，见 architecture-review-20261128 N-1/S3）。bconf 是独立 module，不在本模块包图内，其纯度由 forbid leaf 显式覆盖。",
  "layers": {
    "kernel": [
      "bootstrap"
    ],
    "engine": [
      "pkg/appkit"
    ],
    "kit": [
      "pkg/audit",
      "pkg/authn",
      "pkg/authz",
      "pkg/contextx",
      "pkg/crudbridge",
      "pkg/fieldmaskutil",
      "pkg/grpcdiscovery",
      "pkg/id",
      "pkg/metrics",
      "pkg/metricshttp",
      "pkg/middleware",
      "pkg/semconv",
      "pkg/store",
      "pkg/storeerr",
      "pkg/stringcase",
      "pkg/testkit",
      "pkg/validation"
    ],
    "families": [
      "transport",
      "broker",
      "cache",
      "registry",
      "metrics",
      "log",
      "ratelimit",
      "circuitbreaker",
      "retry",
      "selector",
      "oss",
      "workflow",
      "contrib",
      "health",
      "encoding",
      "bconfig"
    ],
    "leaf": [
      "berrors"
    ],
    "tooling": [
      "tools",
      "internal"
    ]
  },
  "forbid": [
    {
      "from": "kernel",
      "to": [
        "github.com/kalandramo/bald/transport/http*",
        "github.com/kalandramo/bald/transport/grpc*"
      ],
      "reason": "N-1 主判据（architecture-review-20261128）：bootstrap 是装配内核，不得认识具体协议服务器实现；S3 已把服务器工厂归位 transport/{http,grpc}/contract，本条现值 0 命中，触发能力由 internal/archgate 变异测试（注入 bootstrap→transport/http 合成边判红并点名本规则）钉住，防再倒挂"
    },
    {
      "from": "github.com/kalandramo/bald/pkg",
      "to": [
        "github.com/kalandramo/bald/contrib*"
      ],
      "reason": "装配引擎（pkg/appkit）与基础库（pkg/*）不得反向依赖 contrib 扩展适配；现值 0 命中，预防位"
    },
    {
      "from": "leaf",
      "to": [
        "github.com/kalandramo/bald/bootstrap*",
        "github.com/kalandramo/bald/pkg*",
        "github.com/kalandramo/bald/transport*",
        "github.com/kalandramo/bald/contrib*",
        "github.com/kalandramo/bald/bconf*"
      ],
      "reason": "berrors 是纯错误叶（leaf），不得认识 kernel/engine/kit/协议族，也不得拉入独立模块 bconf 的 proto 类型；bconf 不在本模块包图内，allow 矩阵够不着，只能在本条显式列出。bconfig 不再归 leaf：它是配置 SPI 族根（含 apollo/etcd 等实现），与 transport 各族同权"
    }
  ],
  "allow": {
    "kernel": [
      "families",
      "leaf"
    ],
    "engine": [
      "kernel",
      "kit",
      "families",
      "leaf"
    ],
    "kit": [
      "families",
      "leaf"
    ],
    "families": [
      "kernel",
      "engine",
      "kit",
      "leaf"
    ],
    "leaf": [],
    "tooling": [
      "kernel",
      "engine",
      "kit",
      "families",
      "leaf"
    ]
  },
  "strict": {
    "require_layer_under": [
      "github.com/kalandramo/bald"
    ]
  }
}
